{%- comment -%}
  "Hero Impossible" section (exact copy of the evorabody.com hero): a rating badge (square green star tiles + "1.000+ Reviews"), a big two-tone heading (the middle words in gold italic), optional sub line, a 2-column tick list, a gold button with an arrow, a small shield "guarantee" line, and a big rounded picture with a soft shadow on the other side.
  Desktop (wider than 989px) = text and picture side by side, 60px apart. Tablet and phone (989px and narrower) = the picture first, then the text stacked, the button full width on phones.
  No slider, no app, one picture, so it loads fast. The picture loads at once (it is the top of the page) and is served at the right size for every screen.

  WHERE: best as its own full-width section: Online Store > Themes > Customize > Product page > Add section > Custom Liquid, drag it where you want it, paste this in.
  If you paste it inside a narrow column instead, set mb_bleed to false.
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW. Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead, and write & as &amp;
  mb_rating = how many stars are green, from 0 to 5 (4.5 gives a half star). Empty = no stars.
  mb_rating_text = the text next to the stars (leave empty to hide it). The "1.000+ Reviews" here is the number from the section this was copied from: change it to a number that is TRUE for your own store, or empty it. If both mb_rating and mb_rating_text are empty the whole badge disappears.
  mb_heading_1 / mb_heading_2 / mb_heading_3 = the heading in three pieces: normal, then gold italic, then normal again. Leave a piece empty to skip it.
  mb_sub = optional line under the heading (empty in the original).
  mb_bullets = the tick list, items separated by @@ (leave empty to hide the list). mb_cols = 2 (two columns, like the original) or 1.
  mb_btn_text / mb_btn_url / mb_btn_arrow = the button text, where it goes, and the little arrow after the text (empty = no arrow). Empty text hides the button.
  mb_guarantee = the line under the button (empty hides it).
  mb_img = your picture link. mb_img_alt = a short description of it (for Google and screen readers). mb_img_w / mb_img_h = the picture&#39;s real size in pixels, so the page does not jump while it loads.
  mb_eager = true loads the picture straight away (best when this is near the top of the page), false waits until you scroll near it.
  mb_side = which side the picture is on: right or left.
  mb_bg = section colour. mb_color_heading / mb_color_accent = heading colour / gold words. mb_color_body = normal text. mb_color_stars = green of the star tiles. mb_color_check = tick colour. mb_btn_bg / mb_btn_hover / mb_btn_color = button colour / its colour when hovered / its writing. mb_color_guarantee = guarantee line colour.
  mb_gap = space between the text and the picture (desktop). mb_radius = how round the picture corners are. mb_pad_t / mb_pad_b = space above / below inside the section.
  mb_side_d = space left and right of the content on tablet and desktop, in px (40px here). On screens wider than about 1520px the content is exactly as wide as the original (1440px). The original has NO side space (0px), so on screens narrower than 1440px its text runs right up to the screen edge: type 0px if you want that exact look. mb_side_m = the same on phones (600px and narrower, 16px like the original). mb_full = true makes the content full width with 40px side space.
  mb_bleed = true stretches the section edge to edge across the screen. mb_top / mb_bottom = space above and below the block.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_rating = '5' -%}
{%- assign mb_rating_text = '1.000+ Reviews' -%}
{%- assign mb_heading_1 = 'Firm,' -%}
{%- assign mb_heading_2 = 'Smooth Skin.' -%}
{%- assign mb_heading_3 = 'Reclaimed.' -%}
{%- assign mb_sub = '' -%}
